From b8ec0a6f1cdcadeb2911ddcd0cb08e5c03b3b61c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristiyan Kostadinov <crisbeto@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Sep 2024 18:25:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(multiple): switch the CDK to the inject function
 (#29718)

Reworks all of the CDK directives and injectables to use the `inject` function instead of constructor-based injection. All the constructors have a backwards-compatible signature for the apps that may be extending them.
